{"title":"2015 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The average (mean) of the five numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c6878713578626763c38433b3f4c8c2205ad0c15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/5/ce559030966e801b44323c030e1e70dead73b9d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 12.5 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 8 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 9.6 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 9 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"398\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The average of numbers is the sum of the numbers divided by the number of numbers.\n</p><p>From the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> numbers, we see that there is a sum of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/a/fea1fdb17849b8d9e07279903ce1a69b673eb8d3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8 + 9 + 10 + 11 + 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"163\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>We see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/f/b0f6d3ff2c6e8d5bb731f9efc2e2eae48784ae38.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8 + 9 + 10 + 11 + 12 = 17 + 21 + 12 = 38 + 12 = 50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"412\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>The average of the numbers is then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/8/448a927a9cf44288dc784bca4a6571b85ccbfb08.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50 \\div 5 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(E) } 10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"139\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can realize that the numbers are consecutive and there are an odd number of numbers in the list. Thus, the average must just be the median of the numbers.\n</p><p>From the numbers, we see that the median is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/b/b8bc0862e1671436d8cd6d8e67b3bef76f0f5729.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed {\\textbf {(E) } 10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"65\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Fermat\" title=\"2015 CEMC Fermat\">2015 CEMC Fermat</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Fermat_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CEMC Fermat Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Fermat_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CEMC Fermat Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2015 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2015 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2015 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2015 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\"